{"id":"n41884-3-5","stage":2,"title":"내려앉다 · 降临","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41884-3-5-1","ko":"어머, 벌써 어둠이 내려앉았네.","zh":"哎呀，天已经黑了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"어둠이","meaning":"黑暗，昏暗","explanation":"어둠：黑暗，昏暗；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어둠","audio":"/audio/80b84c9158d38546dba3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71586","senseId":"1","lemma":"어둠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어둠이","audio":"/audio/52ea5870087831a79622.mp3"}},{"text":"내려앉았네.","meaning":"降临","explanation":"내려앉다：降临；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"내려앉다","audio":"/audio/1d1e08d58be98a25865d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41884","senseId":"3","lemma":"내려앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내려앉았네","audio":"/audio/7af54d9bad9a26811493.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"80b84c9158d38546","term":"어둠","zh":"黑暗，昏暗","audio":"/audio/80b84c9158d38546dba3.mp3","entryId":"71586","definition":"暗的状态或暗的时候。","pronunciation":["어둠"]},{"id":"1d1e08d58be98a25","term":"내려앉다","zh":"降临","audio":"/audio/1d1e08d58be98a25865d.mp3","entryId":"41884","definition":"烟雾或黑暗等落下来。","pronunciation":["내려안따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2f7c9b5474f41eef66c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41884-3-5-2","ko":"서둘러서 돌아가야겠다.","zh":"得赶紧回去才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서둘러서","meaning":"加紧，加快","explanation":"서두르다：加紧，加快；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"서두르다","audio":"/audio/46ed6fddc77dbc72dcc7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62311","senseId":"2","lemma":"서두르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서둘러서","audio":"/audio/91979a53085c43fbe4f3.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가야겠다.","meaning":"返回","explanation":"돌아가다：返回；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가야겠다","audio":"/audio/0b03767deb9bd80d71a8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"46ed6fddc77dbc72","term":"서두르다","zh":"加紧，加快","audio":"/audio/46ed6fddc77dbc72dcc7.mp3","entryId":"62311","definition":"为了提前做完某事而快速行动。","pronunciation":["서두르다"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"返回","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"回到原来所在的地方或重新成为原来的状态。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fac3a46ebda9f6e17151.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.45,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41884","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2767,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["得赶紧回去才行。","我每次眨眼，睫毛就会不停地戳到眼睛。","哎呀，天已经黑了啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["得赶紧回去才行。","哎呀，天已经黑了啊。","我每次眨眼，睫毛就会不停地戳到眼睛。"],"answer":0}]}
